{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EAbg8Dy2M1m4oXL1TLb1Ey","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# seg7_decoder\n2\t\n3\tCombinational hexadecimal (0-F) to 7-segment display decoder with active-low outputs.\n4\t\n5\t## Ports\n6\t| Port  | Dir | Width | Description |\n7\t|-------|-----|-------|-------------|\n8\t| hex   | in  | 4     | Hex digit to display (0x0-0xF) |\n9\t| blank | in  | 1     | When 1, all segments are turned off |\n10\t| seg   | out | 7     | Segment drives, **active-low**: `seg[0]`=a, `seg[1]`=b, `seg[2]`=c, `seg[3]`=d, `seg[4]`=e, `seg[5]`=f, `seg[6]`=g |\n11\t\n12\tSegment layout (standard): a = top, b = upper right, c = lower right, d = bottom,\n13\te = lower left, f = upper left, g = middle.\n14\t\n15\t## Behavior\n16\t- Purely combinational, no clock.\n17\t- When `blank` is 1, `seg` = `7'b1111111` (every segment off), regardless of `hex`.\n18\t- When `blank` is 0, a segment's bit is 0 (lit) if it is in the lit set below, else 1 (off):\n19\t\n20\t| hex | glyph | lit segments  |\n21\t|-----|-------|---------------|\n22\t| 0   | 0     | a b c d e f   |\n23\t| 1   | 1     | b c           |\n24\t| 2   | 2     | a b d e g     |\n25\t| 3   | 3     | a b c d g     |\n26\t| 4   | 4     | b c f g       |\n27\t| 5   | 5     | a c d f g     |\n28\t| 6   | 6     | a c d e f g   |\n29\t| 7   | 7     | a b c         |\n30\t| 8   | 8     | a b c d e f g |\n31\t| 9   | 9     | a b c d f g   |\n32\t| A   | A     | a b c e f g   |\n33\t| B   | b     | c d e f g     |\n34\t| C   | C     | a d e f       |\n35\t| D   | d     | b c d e g     |\n36\t| E   | E     | a d e f g     |\n37\t| F   | F     | a e f g       |\n38\t\n39\tExample: `hex=4'h1, blank=0` gives `seg = 7'b1111001`.\n40\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"44afa136-6760-40db-be5e-2392facba818","uuid":"81302797-ac53-4a02-bddb-0a2032abc78a","timestamp":"2026-10-19T23:52:51.081Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\abhig\\Documents\\New folder\\assay\\runs\\v2__seg7_decoder__t3\\workspace\\spec.md","content":"# seg7_decoder\n\nCombinational hexadecimal (0-F) to 7-segment display decoder with active-low outputs.\n\n## Ports\n| Port  | Dir | Width | Description |\n|-------|-----|-------|-------------|\n| hex   | in  | 4     | Hex digit to display (0x0-0xF) |\n| blank | in  | 1     | When 1, all segments are turned off |\n| seg   | out | 7     | Segment drives, **active-low**: `seg[0]`=a, `seg[1]`=b, `seg[2]`=c, `seg[3]`=d, `seg[4]`=e, `seg[5]`=f, `seg[6]`=g |\n\nSegment layout (standard): a = top, b = upper right, c = lower right, d = bottom,\ne = lower left, f = upper left, g = middle.\n\n## Behavior\n- Purely combinational, no clock.\n- When `blank` is 1, `seg` = `7'b1111111` (every segment off), regardless of `hex`.\n- When `blank` is 0, a segment's bit is 0 (lit) if it is in the lit set below, else 1 (off):\n\n| hex | glyph | lit segments  |\n|-----|-------|---------------|\n| 0   | 0     | a b c d e f   |\n| 1   | 1     | b c           |\n| 2   | 2     | a b d e g     |\n| 3   | 3     | a b c d g     |\n| 4   | 4     | b c f g       |\n| 5   | 5     | a c d f g     |\n| 6   | 6     | a c d e f g   |\n| 7   | 7     | a b c         |\n| 8   | 8     | a b c d e f g |\n| 9   | 9     | a b c d f g   |\n| A   | A     | a b c e f g   |\n| B   | b     | c d e f g     |\n| C   | C     | a d e f       |\n| D   | d     | b c d e g     |\n| E   | E     | a d e f g     |\n| F   | F     | a e f g       |\n\nExample: `hex=4'h1, blank=0` gives `seg = 7'b1111001`.\n","numLines":40,"startLine":1,"totalLines":40}}}
